@startuml CD-4
!include ../_style.iuml
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 50
title CD-4 (Software level, CSMS) — Class diagram of WF-04: Charge Point fault, alert and remote reset\nFrom apps/csms/src at origin/main ce3902c · Behaviour: SD-4a, SD-4b · State: STM-6, STM-2
footer Owner: Trần Trọng Nghĩa (WP4) · v2.0 · 01/11/2026 · names = code (StationsService / RemoteCommandService / OcppDispatchService of v1 do not exist) · «planned» = design only

package "ocpp-gateway" {
  class OcppHandlers <<component>> {
    + dispatch(action : string, params : unknown, ctx : InboundContext) : object
  }
  class ConnectionRegistry <<component>> {
    + get(identity : string) : Connection
  }
}
package "sessions" {
  class SessionsService <<component>> {
    + onStatusNotification(req, ctx) : void
  }
}
package "stations / faults" {
  class FaultService <<component>> {
    + onConnectorStatus(input : ConnectorStatusInput) : StatusOutcome
    + acknowledge(faultId : number, operatorId : number) : void
    + beginReset(faultId : number, opts : ResetOptions) : BeginResetResult
    + markSent(commandId : number) : void
    + onResetResult(commandId : number, result : ResetResult) : void
    + onResetTimeout(faultId : number, commandId : number) : timed_out | noop
    + close(faultId : number, operatorId : number) : void
    + reportFromDriver(driverId : number, connectorId : number, text : string) : FaultReport «planned»
  }
  class FaultStateMachine {
    + apply(from : FaultStatus, trigger : FaultTrigger) : FaultStatus
  }
  class ErrorCodeGuide <<utility>> {
    + guideFor(errorCode : string) : Guide
  }
  enum FaultStatus <<enumeration>> {
    raised
    acknowledged
    resetting
    resolved
  }
}
package "console" {
  class ConsoleCommands <<component>> {
    + acknowledgeFault(id : number) : void
    + resetFault(id : number, type : Soft | Hard) : ResetReply
    + closeFault(id : number) : void
  }
}
package "entities (tables)" {
  class Connector <<entity>> {
    + connectorNo : 1..2
    + status : ConnectorStatus
  }
  class ConnectorStatusEvent <<entity>> {
    + status : ConnectorStatus
    + errorCode : string
    + unexpectedTransition : boolean
  }
  class FaultEvent <<entity>> {
    + source : ocpp | driver_report
    + status : FaultStatus
    + raisedAt : Date
  }
  class RemoteCommand <<entity>> {
    + action : string
    + status : pending | sent | accepted | rejected | timeout | failed
  }
  class FaultReport <<entity>> {
    + description : string
    + reportedAt : Date
  }
  class MaintenanceTicket <<entity>> {
    + status : open | in_progress | closed
  }
}

OcppHandlers --> SessionsService
OcppHandlers --> FaultService
ConsoleCommands --> FaultService
ConsoleCommands --> ConnectionRegistry : send Reset
FaultService --> FaultStateMachine
FaultService ..> ErrorCodeGuide : <<use>>
FaultStateMachine ..> FaultStatus
SessionsService ..> Connector : <<update>>
SessionsService ..> ConnectorStatusEvent : <<create>>
FaultService ..> FaultEvent : <<create / update>>
FaultService ..> RemoteCommand : <<create>>
Connector "1" -- "0..*" FaultEvent : has >
FaultEvent "0..1" -- "0..*" FaultReport : raised by >
FaultEvent "1" -- "0..1" RemoteCommand : reset by >
FaultEvent "1" -- "0..*" MaintenanceTicket : [Should]

note bottom of ConsoleCommands
  Iteration 1 operator API; the dashboard
  operator-api «planned» calls the same
  FaultService operations
end note
@enduml
